Kehte The Aale Aaba Margaye Zainab Ke Laal<br>
Haaye Yeh Kya Hogya Margaye Zainab K Laal<br>
<br>
1.Teer O Sina Khake Haaye, Gir Padhe Aur Sar Kataaye<br>
Laash Koi Jaake Laaye, Margaye Zainab Ke Laal<br>
<br>
2. Mamu Par Qurba'n Huwe, Payas Se Bejaa'n Huwe<br>
Zakhmo'n Se Haairan Huwe, Margaye Zainab Ke Laal<br>
<br>
3.Leate Hai Woh Sar Kataye, Aur Lahoo Me Nahahe<br>
Kya Huwa Yeh Haaye Haaye, Margaye Zainab Ke Laal.